Description: Finder file manager for Pulsar OS
 macOS Finder-style file manager with Icons, List and Columns views,
 spacebar Quick Look preview and thumbnail generation for images,
 videos and PDFs, sidebar with Applications shortcut and color tags,
 context menu with ZIP compression, Move to, FlyDrop sharing and color tags,
 file chooser/picker mode for browser and application file dialogs,
 and Liquid Glass styled controls.
